<title>THAILAND: TABLE - Bangkok Expressway posts Q2 loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Bangkok Expressway posts Q2 loss.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>		  (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				     Second quarter</p>
<p>				 1997			  1996</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss     0.05     vs   profit    0.22</p>
<p>    Net	   loss    41.38     vs   profit  171.30</p>
<p>					 Six months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  loss     0.09     vs   profit    0.33</p>
<p>    Net	   loss    70.86     vs   profit  256.65</p>
<p>Notes: Results are reviewed. The company's full name is Bangkok Expressway Plc, is an toll road operator.</p>
